{"id":"442616","name":"桂花酒酿蛋花羹","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/442616/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"甜酒酿","amount":"1罐"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1只"}],"sub":[{"name":"冰糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"糖桂花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：甜酒酿。","img":"images/442616/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋、冰糖、糖桂花。","img":"images/442616/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"水淀粉。","img":"images/442616/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅里倒入适量的清水烧开。","img":"images/442616/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"下入甜酒酿、冰糖煮开。","img":"images/442616/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"接着，倒入水淀粉勾芡。","img":"images/442616/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"然后，倒入蛋液搅匀，出锅。","img":"images/442616/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撒上适量的糖桂花，即成。","img":"images/442616/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}